The '''Fear Mongerer''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|Village}} during the [[Spooky Festival]]. They sell items in exchange for {{c}} and Candy.

They are also in the Village for a one hour window before and after the Spooky Festival, available to trade items.

